  "solution": {
    "text": "Using equation of trajectory for a projectile motion :<br /><br /><math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>g</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br />For the projectile to pass through (30 m, 40 m) :<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mtext>40</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>30 tan</mtext> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mtext>&#945;</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>g (30)</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>2u</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> </mfrac> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mo>+</mo> <msup> <mtext>tan</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mtext>&#945;</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math><br /><br />or &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>900</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>900</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />For real value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math>. The discriminant of a quadratic equation <math><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8805;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3600</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>900</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br />or &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>800</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8805;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>00</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>00</mn></math><br /><br />or &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>400</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8805;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>000</mn><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br />or &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>400</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8805;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>500</mn></math><br /><br />or &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8805;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>900</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></math>&nbsp;or &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8805;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>"
  }
